Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Cosmic Absorption Plan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 57
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The photos are moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to come in, but you insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, there’s no way you’re leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t face him head-on right now; I have to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you wondering how to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:01:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, perhaps by pretending to walk toward the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and actually escaping through the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I know exactly what you’re thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I am you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born in a village on the Wasteland Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Humphrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,In our world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,we don’t know when life begins,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:01:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,or when it will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:02:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For us, mere existence is an immense luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.38,0:02:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know the meaning of life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,until that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you all hiding from me? Am I that terrifying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don’t eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ungrateful wretch. This is a merging.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To merge into one with me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and survive together—isn’t that wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Only our leader possesses this ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you again. Why do you always stand in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have to protect this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re about to vanish, yet you still try to play the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Merge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re really out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No…I don’t want it to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My mission isn’t over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Become a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t—I won’t let you hurt everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,W-what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my village; I have to protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Leader…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Leader…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I realize I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll turn over a new leaf. Let’s live in peace from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I’m back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.99,0:04:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, you’re my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter our personalities or backgrounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,ultimately, the path leads to saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.56,0:04:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there; I’ll pull you up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and help save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where’s Tyger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is our world really going to be destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, everyone; I’ll find a way to save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this way, we don’t have to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I’ve turned over a new leaf. Please spare us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’ve turned over a new leaf,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,then join me in saving this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I need more power
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Things can’t go on like this forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a beautiful world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a warm feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a lovely scent
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here is so wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the life I long for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we not stay in other worlds for too long?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she can make my dream come true
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She can’t disappear just yet
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I went on to visit other worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But the one that left the deepest impression on me was Green Green Grassland
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you there, constantly saving the world and becoming a hero
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I’m exactly like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,we lead such vastly different lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.90,0:07:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the basketball here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I long for all of this too, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You stayed in that world for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body started to reject it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,After all…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,that world doesn’t belong to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do they get to have such a wonderful world…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,while for us, even just staying alive is a luxury?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If the world is so unfair…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.77,0:08:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall redefine the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If only one of these many worlds can remain,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.81,0:08:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it has to be our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.89,0:08:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve noticed that whenever a world is in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,there’s always a version of me that steps up to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.57,0:09:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Weslies are all too driven by emotion;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,they could never stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My only mistake was meeting you that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day, the conflict between us has never ceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you understand yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My will resides within those fragments,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,influencing everyone who obtains my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You hate the thought of it, don’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.59,0:09:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If they rescue the old king from the Thorn Forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,everything you have now will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can give you power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.07,0:10:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you simply fuse Jay’s fragment with your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you will gain even greater power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.75,0:10:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat more withered leaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to save your world?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I stirred up their desires everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,just to make them fight over my fragments,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I could eventually be resurrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I’m the one who gets the last laugh now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:11:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, everyone was manipulated by you? I will never let you get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you enjoy the sunshine, the grasslands, and the blue skies,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,saving the world with ease and becoming a hero everyone loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about me? If you had experienced my despair,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,would you still say things like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.43,0:11:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I sympathize with what you’ve been through, but there must be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just like you to spout such high-sounding words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But it’s no use; this is my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I’m going to see this through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.27,0:11:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re out of options now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch as I save my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie and the Absorption Device should be right down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s break right through.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
